00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:30.000
And by fortified wine, they mean they add brandy to it, which will raise the sugar

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.000
content.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:34.330
It also stops the fermentation process.

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:39.290
