00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:35.530
Again, you'd have that raw flour taste, and it would just be really gummy and starchy.

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:47.170
So just pass these through. Again, the key is just to shake it off a little bit. Now,

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:51.750
if you have extra flour here, as you can see in the bowl, I have extra flour. You don't

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:56.580
